DLG 0
This is your passport. Collect tickets from all destinations to complete your journey.
NAME passport_dialog

DLG 1
Progress:
Japan: {japan_done == 1 ? Complete : Not started}
Morocco: {morocco_done == 1 ? Complete : Not started}
Peru: {peru_done == 1 ? Complete : Not started}
{japan_done == 1 && morocco_done == 1 && peru_done == 1 ? All destinations complete! You are a world traveler! : Keep traveling!}
NAME progress_dialog

DLG 2
{japan_done == 1 ? You have completed your journey to Japan. The path is now closed. : North: Japan. A land of snow and shrines.}
NAME japan_guide_dialog

DLG 3
{morocco_done == 1 ? You have explored the markets of Morocco. The path is now closed. : West: Morocco. Markets and deserts.}
NAME morocco_guide_dialog

DLG 4
{peru_done == 1 ? You have seen the ruins of Peru. The path is now closed. : East: Peru. Mountains and forests.}
NAME peru_guide_dialog

